      "paperId": "1987f0028349d6ff270102801d94880e542a2197",
      "title": "\u201cThe Wissenschaftslehre 1804 (2)\u201d of J. G. Fichte in the context of the history of philosophy",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "A. A. Ivanenko",
